5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We need to stop guessing and start looking at the facts.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, Misaki. Let’s see what the records actually say before we argue.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I’m in. I’m curious what a household actually pays when they end up with nowhere to keep a bike.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,George,,I’d like to understand the actual workload involved in maintaining any new system we choose.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I want to check if the current spots really match where people park, or if it’s just a rumor.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, that’s a good point. We should check the ward cycle park rates to see the real cost of losing a spot.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, I’d like to see the morning departures to understand the shoving match you mentioned.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@George, I’ll check the building’s ledger to see what we actually have in the shared account for any new costs.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,George,,"@Shizue, I’ll look into the treasurer’s handover file to see how much time the current cash collections actually take.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, I’ll check the sticker register to see who actually rides daily and how many bikes each flat has.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I’ll check the complaint log to see how past disputes actually played out.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I’ll look into the rain exposure along the rows to see which spots actually stay dry.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I’ll check the ward cycle park by the station to see what people pay when they lose a spot.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,George,,I’ll examine the five years of association minutes to see how the current arrangement was originally decided.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,I’ll check the account from the neighbouring block’s secretary to see how their system is working.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I’ll also look into the morning departures to see exactly how the morning rush plays out.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I’ll also check the five years of association minutes to see if the current arrangement was ever properly reviewed.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,I’ll also check the building account’s two-year ledger to see what capital work would actually cost us.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,George,,I’ll also examine the trial of the supplier’s display frame to see the physical effort required for double-tier racks.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mio,,I’ll also check the last year’s complaint log entries to see if the grumbling is backed by actual records.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
