35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: The complaint log shows nine disputes last year, all unresolved. We need a system that prevents this.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: The minutes show the same flats held the covered spots for five years, with no review.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"- **May**: The ward park costs 2,600 yen monthly, and our ledger shows zero capital funds.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,George,,"- **George**: The handover file shows three hours monthly just for current collections, and the rack trial took twenty seconds per bike.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: The sticker register shows daily riders would rather pay than be treated as equal, and the complaints are real.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @Mio, that’s worrying. If daily riders prefer paying, does that mean a lottery would just create resentment?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @May, that 2,600 yen figure is steep. It makes me wonder if we can afford to lose those riders to the station park.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"- **May**: @George, three hours monthly is a lot. If we add billing, won’t that workload crush whoever takes it on?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,George,,"- **George**: @May, it’s manageable, but the rack trial showed the physical strain is real. We need to balance both.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: @Misaki, I think a lottery is risky. If people feel the system is unfair, the grumbling will only get worse.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @Mio, exactly. My morning watch showed four people shifting bikes just to leave. We need to stop that friction.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @Misaki, that matches what I saw. The rain-soaked spots are causing the mess, not just the numbers.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"- **May**: @George, so if we charge, we’re adding hours to an already tired role. That’s a red flag for me.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,George,,"@May, I understand the concern, but the ledger shows we have no capital funds. We must weigh the cost of inaction against the administrative burden.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: @George, fair point. But if the workload is too heavy, won’t it just get abandoned like the last two jobs?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @Mio, that’s the real danger. If it lapses, we’re back to nine unresolved complaints. We need a system that survives neglect.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @Misaki, I worry about that too. A system that relies on one person’s energy will eventually fail, just like before.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"- **May**: @George, so if we charge, we’re adding hours to an already tired role. That’s a red flag for me.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,George,,"@May, I hear you. But the ledger is empty. Without income, we can’t fix the rain damage or buy better racks.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: @George, I get it. But if the system collapses, we’re back to square one. We need something simple enough to last.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
